Spoilers follow:


The One True Amulet has the following effects on its possessor:

1.  It has an obvious effect on your ability to cast spells (You feel the
	amulet draining your magical powers... or some such message)

2.  You get clairvoyance (limited magic mapping) as long as you carry it.

The cheap plastic imitations do NOT have these effects.

So it should be rather easy to determine if you have the One True Amulet.  If
you cannot figure it out given these hints, how did you get the Amulet in the
first place :-)

PS:  Note that you can #name the Amulet, ie

i: an Amulet of Yendor named the real thing

This helps to determine which of those fifteen amulets the dead wizard has
is the real one...

